    "The discrete-series formal degree and polarized Schur orthogonality, lowest-type Cartan decay and positivity, positivity of the Fock coefficients on joint harmonics, compact highest-weight classification and Cartan decomposition are inputs to this reconstruction. The proof of the definite-partner simplification is quoted.",
